      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "entailed",
      "supporting_ids": [
        "PMC8398136::chunk::000::abstract::92875111a7"
      ],
      "same_system": "unclear"
    },
    {
      "text": "In CoNiCrFeMn nanowires, lattice-parameter differences among constituent atoms increase friction against partial-dislocation motion.",
      "field": "mechanism",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "entailed",
      "supporting_ids": [
        "PMC8398136::chunk::000::abstract::92875111a7"
      ],
      "same_system": "yes"
    },
    {
      "text": "Increased dislocation friction raises yield strength.",
      "field": "hypothesis",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "partial",
      "supporting_ids": [
        "PMC8398136::chunk::000::abstract::92875111a7"
      ],
      "same_system": "unclear"
    },
    {
      "text": "Obstruction of dislocation glide promotes deformation twinning.",
      "field": "mechanism",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "Obstruction of dislocation glide promotes deformation-induced phase transformations.",
      "field": "mechanism",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "Twinning and phase transformations act as secondary plasticity mechanisms that mediate ductility.",
      "field": "hypothesis",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "unsupported",
      "supporting_ids": [],
      "same_system": "na"
    },
    {
      "text": "The strength–failure balance is governed by an interplay between lattice-distortion-induced glide resistance and secondary plasticity mechanisms.",
      "field": "hypothesis",
      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "partial",
      "supporting_ids": [
        "PMC8398136::chunk::000::abstract::92875111a7"
      ],
      "same_system": "unclear"
    },
    {
      "text": "CoNiCrFeMn has meaningful lattice-parameter variations among its constituent atoms.",
